\n\r\nPouzdro do s\u00e1drokartonu s otev\u0159enou strukturou m\u00e1 schopnost vydr\u017eet o 20% v\u00edce bo\u010dn\u00edho oh\u00fdb\u00e1n\u00ed, ne\u017e jin\u00e9  podobn\u00e9 konstrukce na sou\u010dasn\u00e9m trhu *.\r\nZes\u00edlen\u00e9 svisl\u00e9 v\u00fdztuhy, spojen\u00e9 s vodorovn\u00fdmi profily, spolu tvo\u0159\u00ed konstrukci mnohem pevn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e pouzdro vyroben\u00e9 z jednoho kusu plechu.\r\n\r\n* viz. intern\u00ed laboratorn\u00ed testy prov\u00e1d\u011bn\u00e9 na r\u016fzn\u00fdch ekvivalentn\u00edch konstrukc\u00edch.\r\n\r\n\r\n   \r\n     Zes\u00edlen\u00e9 omega profily\r\nSpeci\u00e1ln\u011b profilovan\u00e9 p\u0159\u00ed\u010dn\u00e9 v\u00fdztuhy z pozinkovan\u00e9ho plechu tl. 0,7 mm poskytuj\u00ed odoln\u00ed vnit\u0159n\u00ed prostor pro bezpe\u010dn\u00e9 veden\u00ed dve\u0159n\u00edho k\u0159\u00eddla.\r\n\r\n     12 Svisl\u00e9 v\u00fdztuhy\r\nSvisl\u00e9 v\u00fdztuhy jsou vyrobeny ze zes\u00edlen\u00e9 oceli (1,2 mm) a jsou speci\u00e1ln\u011b vyztu\u017een\u00e9, aby odolaly vertik\u00e1ln\u00edm tlak\u016fm.\r\n\r\n Vrchn\u00ed kovov\u00e1 traverza\r\nJe navr\u017eena tak, aby zv\u00fd\u0161ila rezistenci p\u0159\u00edpadn\u00fdch tlak\u016f.\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t    \r\n\t\t    \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t    \r\n\t\t\r\n]]><\/DESCRIPTION><CATEGORYTEXT>D\u016fm, byt a zahrada | Stavebniny | Stavebn\u00ed v\u00fdpln\u011b | Dve\u0159e a p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161enstv\u00ed | Stavebn\u00ed pouzdra<\/CATEGORYTEXT><MANUFACTURER><![CDATA[ECLISSE]]><\/MANUFACTURER><URL>https:\/\/test.optim-door.cz\/stavebni-pouzdra\/stavebni-pouzdro-eclisse-do-sadrokartonu<\/URL><DELIVERY_DATE>0<\/DELIVERY_DATE><IMGURL>https:\/\/test.optim-door.cz\/image\/cache\/catalog\/stavebni-pouzdra\/eclisse\/do-sadrokartonu\/stavebni-pouzdro-ECLISSE-500x500.jpg<\/IMGURL><ITEMGROUP_ID>1718<\/ITEMGROUP_ID><PRICE_VAT>6915<\/PRICE_VAT><\/SHOPITEM><SHOPITEM><ITEM_ID>1719<\/ITEM_ID><PRODUCTNAME><![CDATA[ECLISSE Stavebn\u00ed pouzdro ECLISSE jednok\u0159\u00eddl\u