ulac\u00ed v bezfalcov\u00e9m proveden\u00ed.\r\n  Klasick\u00fd z\u00e1mek ve falcov\u00e9m nebo magnetick\u00fd v bezfalcov\u00e9m k\u0159\u00eddle na dozick\u00fd kl\u00ed\u010d, na cylindrickou vlo\u017eku, WC z\u00e1mek, \u00fasporn\u00fd z\u00e1mek (jen klika).\r\n\r\n\r\nPROSKLEN\u00cd\r\n\r\n   Nejpopul\u00e1rn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed sklo ml\u00e9\u010dn\u00e9 DECORMAT nebo \u010dir\u00e9 v cen\u011b dve\u0159\u00ed.\r\n   Mo\u017enost volby matn\u00e9 (A-avers) a hladk\u00e9 strany matn\u00e9ho skla.\r\n\r\n]]><\/DESCRIPTION><CATEGORYTEXT>D\u016fm, byt a zahrada | Stavebniny | Stavebn\u00ed v\u00fdpln\u011b | Dve\u0159e a p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161enstv\u00ed | Interi\u00e9rov\u00e9 dve\u0159e<\/CATEGORYTEXT><MANUFACTURER><![CDATA[ERKADO]]><\/MANUFACTURER><URL>https:\/\/test.optim-door.cz\/interierove-dvere\/interierove-dvoukridle-dvere\/dvoukridle-dvere-altamura-2<\/URL><DELIVERY_DATE>30<\/DELIVERY_DATE><IMGURL>https:\/\/test.optim-door.cz\/image\/cache\/catalog\/dvere\/dvoukridle-dvere\/STANDART\/Altamura\/dd-dvere-altamura_02-500x500.jpg<\/IMGURL><ITEMGROUP_ID>3287<\/ITEMGROUP_ID><PRICE_VAT>6655<\/PRICE_VAT><\/SHOPITEM><SHOPITEM><ITEM_ID>1395<\/ITEM_ID><PRODUCTNAME><![CDATA[ERKADO Dvouk\u0159\u00eddl\u00e9 dve\u0159e FRAGI]]><\/PRODUCTNAME><PRODUCT><![CDATA[Dvouk\u0159\u00eddl\u00e9 dve\u0159e FRAGI]]><\/PRODUCT><DESCRIPTION><![CDATA[KONSTRUKCE\r\n\r\n  K\u0159\u00eddlo vyroben\u00e9 v r\u00e1mov\u00e9 technologii STILE.\r\n  Masivn\u00ed 14 cm r\u00e1m MDF pro povrchy 3D GREKO.\r\n  Masivn\u00ed 14 cm d\u0159ev\u011bn\u00fd r\u00e1m pro povrchy PREMIUM a CPL LAMIN\u00c1T.\r\n  Estetick\u00e9 zasklen\u00ed bez pou\u017eit\u00ed r\u00e1me\u010dku p\u0159id\u00e1v\u00e1 dve\u0159\u00edm luxusn\u00ed vzhled.\r\n  M\u00edrn\u011b zaoblen\u00e9 hrany dve\u0159\u00ed, na hran\u011b nejsou \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 spoje, co\u017e p\u0159isp\u00edv\u00e1 k del\u0161\u00ed \u017eivotnosti dve\u0159\u00ed.\r\n  Povrchov\u00e1 \u00faprava: nejpopul\u00e1rn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed p