lin\u00edkov\u00e1 kolejnice v\u010detn\u011b dvoulo\u017eiskov\u00fdch silikonov\u00fdch kole\u010dek, spodn\u00ed vod\u00edc\u00ed trn, mont\u00e1\u017en\u00ed dr\u017e\u00e1ky, p\u0159edn\u00ed p\u0159ekryt\u00ed.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nP\u0159ednost\u00ed jsou dod\u00e1van\u00e1 kvalitn\u00ed silikonov\u00e1 kole\u010dka na kovov\u00e9m voz\u00edku - \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd plast.\r\n\r\n\r\nA co d\u00e1l? Pouze na\u0161e spole\u010dnost V\u00e1m nab\u00eddne zdarma bo\u010dn\u00ed p\u0159ekryt\u00ed kolejnice, jeliko\u017e ho vyr\u00e1b\u00edme sami. Pozor, \u017d\u00e1dn\u00fd jin\u00ed prodejci toto nenab\u00edz\u00ed.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nZa p\u0159\u00edplatek lze objednat tich\u00fd doraz pro pohodln\u00e9 tich\u00e9 dov\u00edran\u00ed dve\u0159\u00ed na jednu nebo ob\u011b strany.\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  Barevnost: B\u00edl\u00e1 garny\u017e a B\u00edl\u00e9 K\u0159\u00eddlo.\r\n  Zcela jednoduch\u00e1 mont\u00e1\u017e, kterou zvl\u00e1dne ka\u017ed\u00fd kutil, viz p\u0159ilo\u017een\u00fd mont\u00e1\u017en\u00ed n\u00e1vod. Mont\u00e1\u017e bez mo\u017enosti slep\u00e9 z\u00e1rubn\u011b, pouze na za\u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00fd stavebn\u00ed otvor s max. v\u00fd\u0161kou 203 cm.\r\n  \r\n  D\u00e9lka garny\u017ee:\r\n- 205 cm pro rozm\u011bry 76 cm, 86 cm, 96 cm. Garny\u017e je z jednoho kusu.\r\n- 220 cm pro rozm\u011br 106 cm. Garn\u00fd\u017e se skl\u00e1da ze dvou li\u0161t spojen\u00fdch kol\u00edkov\u00fdm syst\u00e9mem, viz mont\u00e1\u017en\u00ed n\u00e1vod.\r\n\r\nV\u00fd\u0161ka garny\u017ee je 9,5 cm.\r\n\r\nBalen\u00ed: Polystyren + karton\r\n\r\n]]><\/DESCRIPTION><CATEGORYTEXT>D\u016fm, byt a zahrada | Stavebniny | Stavebn\u00ed v\u00fdpln\u011b | Dve\u0159e a p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161enstv\u00ed | Interi\u00e9rov\u00e9 dve\u0159e<\/CATEGORYTEXT><MANUFACTURER><![CDATA[VILEN DOOR]]><\/MANUFACTURER><URL>https:\/\/test.optim-door.cz\/posuvne-dvere\/na-stenu\/rada-vilen\/mirror-plus<\/URL><DELIVERY_DATE>30<\/DELIVERY_DATE><IMGURL><\/IMGURL><ITEMGROUP_ID>3954<\/ITEM